{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ko",
  "strings" : {
    "‘대략적인 위치’에서는 위치만으로 새 제한을 적용하거나 기존 제한을 해제하지 않아요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to use the location setting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With ‘Approximate Location’, location alone won’t start a new restriction or end an existing one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘정확한 위치’를 켜 주세요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to enable precise location.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on ‘Precise Location’."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘한 번만 허용’을 선택했거나 ‘항상 허용’으로 변경하지 않았다면, 설정에서 위치 접근을 ‘항상’으로 바꿔 주세요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you chose ‘Allow Once’ or did not change the permission to ‘Always’, change Location access to ‘Always’ in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "‘항상 허용’으로 변경해 주세요." : {
      "comment" : "A phrase that instructs the user to change the location permission to \"Always\" in the system settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Change it to ‘Always’."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“나서”가 사용자의\n위치를 사용하도록 허용할까요?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allow “Naseo” to use\nyour location?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“나서”가 사용자의\n위치를 항상 사용하도록\n허용할까요?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allow “Naseo” to use\nyour location even when\nyou are not using the app?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“나서”가 화면 사용 시간에\n접근하도록 허용할까요?" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the family controls permission.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Allow “Naseo” to access\nScreen Time?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@" : {
      "comment" : "A checkmark icon followed by a title and description of a specific app permission. The title and description are generated from the `overviewTitle` and `overviewDescription` functions, respectively. The argument is the string “앱 사용 제한”, the string “위치 접근 · 항상”, the string “정확한 위치”, or the string “Background App Refresh”.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@ %@ %@ %@" : {
      "comment" : "A clock face with a start time and end time. The first argument is the start time. The second argument is the start time period (AM/PM). The third argument is the end time. The fourth argument is the end time period (AM/PM).",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@ %3$@ %4$@ %5$@"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@ %3$@ %4$@ %5$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 삭제" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@/%@" : {
      "comment" : "A label showing the number of characters in the current location name. The first argument is the current number of characters. The second argument is the maximum allowed number of characters.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
